  {
   "type": "table",
   "rows": [
    [
     "By Taking out Common Factors",
     "By Grouping Terms"
    ],
    [
     "For example,\n(i) 6r^{2} + 4rs\n= 2r (3r) + 2r (2s)\n= 2r (3r + 2s)\n(ii) a(b + 1) – 2(b + 1)\n= (b + 1)(a – 2)",
     "For example,\n(i) hk + 1 + h + k\n= hk + h + 1 + k\n= h(k + 1) + (k + 1)\n= (k + 1)(h + 1)"
    ],
    [
     "By Using the Identities",
     "By Using the Cross-method"
    ],
    [
     "For any values of a and b,\n• a^{2} – b^{2} ≡ (a + b)(a – b)\n• a^{2} + 2ab + b^{2} ≡ (a + b)^{2}\n• a^{2} – 2ab + b^{2} ≡ (a – b)^{2}\nFor example,\n(i) 4x^{2} – 25\n= (2x)^{2} – 5^{2}\n^{ }= (2x + 5)(2x – 5)\n(ii) a^{2} + 6a + 9\n= a^{2} + 2(a)(3) + 3^{2}\n= (a + 3)^{2}\n(iii) 9m^{2} – 12mn + 4n^{2}\n= (3m)^{2} – 2(3m)(2n) + (2n)^{2}\n= (3m – 2n)^{2}",
     "For example,\n(i) x^{2} + 5x + 6\n= (x + 2)(x + 3)\n(ii) 6x^{2} – 13x – 5\n= (2x – 5)(3x + 1)\n(iii) 3x^{2} – 5xy + 2y^{2}\n= (3x – 2y)(x – y)"
    ]
   ]
