    [
     "Factorize\n(a) 15x^{2} + xy – 2y^{2},\n(b) 9x – 3y – 15x^{2} – xy + 2y^{2}.               (3 marks)\nSolution\n(a) 15x^{2} + xy – 2y^{2}\n= (3x – y)(5x + 2y)                        (1A)\n(b) 9x – 3y – 15x^{2} – xy + 2y^{2}\n= (9x – 3y) – (15x^{2} + xy – 2y^{2})  → Group the terms.\n= 3(3x – y) – (3x – y)(5x + 2y) (1M: Use the result of (a).)\n= (3x – y)(3 – 5x – 2y)  (1A)",
